# Build context hygiene.
# Docker anchors patterns at the context root, so every rule that must
# apply to nested paths needs an explicit **/ prefix — without it,
# backend/data/weekly_report.db would be copied into a published image.

**/.git
**/.gitignore

# Secrets and local databases (never ship personal data in an image)
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/data
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3

# Dependencies and caches
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache

# Build output
**/dist

# Local tooling and editor state
**/.dev
**/.impeccable
**/.claude
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/.DS_Store
**/scripts
**/app/frontend

# Docs are not part of the runtime image
**/*.md
!README.md
**/.editorconfig
